# The Super Hero Civil War, the whole Saga. I steals Bot2's Hill Giant (3/3) while Grizzly Bears (2/2) stays with Bot2. II gives the
# creatures Bot1 controls +1/+1 and vigilance until end of turn: the stolen Giant is 4/4, the Bears are not touched, and it is over
